  "prefLabel": "Ph 602.01 Biennial Registration Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 602.01 Biennial Registration Required. Pursuant to Ph 601.06, every person, or corporate entity that is not a licensed pharmacy, engaged in supplying medical gases to the consuming public, or to a patient or a patient's agent, in the state of New Hampshire, shall renew biennially with the board as a limited retail drug distributor no later than June 15th of every odd-numbered year.\n\nSource. #12335, eff 7-22-17; ss by #13117, eff 10-15-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
